-- statement:
--   For any majorized cut system $S$ of arity $n+(r+1)$, first viewing its arity as $(n+1)+r$, advancing $r$ steps, and taking the next system gives the same system as advancing $r+1$ steps and reindexing by the canonical equivalence that appends the final endpoint pair.
